# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) from Sauromugue Champaign, the four Large Memory Fragments held: the Cavernous Maw plays 503
# [2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 651, 636808, 1]; its finish sets Status 1 and Option 120, and the next tick shows the set-down at 800
# 71.839 770 rot 63 in Grauberg [S]. The login there at Status 1 plays the zone-in 33, left open; the finish sets Status
# 2 and xi.maws.goToMaw sends the char to xi.maws.pastMaws[120]: the next tick shows Sauromugue Champaign [S] at 366.858
# 8.545 -228.861 rot 95. The login there at Status 2 completes the mission (Pillar of Hope current) and takes the four
# fragments (xi.wotg.helpers.removeMemoryFragments).
